.A. - ABB SACE Division","publisherUrl":"https://global.abb/"},"zh-CN":{"description":"ABB LP 设计软件聚合。","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"用户手册","DocumentUrl":"https://search.abb.com/library/Download.aspx?DocumentID=9AKK106103A3850&LanguageCode=en&Action=Launch"}],"license":"专有软件","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"ABB 推出了一款全新的工程设计软件套件 e-Design，旨在满足电气行业专业人士在不断变化的市场中的需求。\ne-Design 让电气系统的设计成为可能，通过直观、简单的功能来访问可以协同使用的产品套件，最大限度地优化了生产时间。\n该套件外观新颖，极具吸引力，同时对 ABB 软件一贯的功能进行了全面优化，使其成为与当前行业技术同步的创新工具。"}},"publisherUrl":"https://global.abb/","releaseDate":"2026-11-10","releaseDateSource":"commit","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"411ee5b30152224ab652f0629684a360adabd366","manifestVersion":"1.28.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/a/ABB/e-Design/1.17.0.0004/ABB.e-Design.installer.yaml","sha256":"e60f103639ea783f91f5e088a64d18e187e629891bba1372d0f818a95677d900"},{"path":"manifests/a/ABB/e-Design/1.17.0.0004/ABB.e-Design.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"8e28ad4d34f243ce489797009e231d0adbb9284450be8491621973eb12a7a1d9"},{"path":"manifests/a/ABB/e-Design/1.17.0.0004/ABB.e-Design.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"746f7487224627111a8d587905d8e95716aec6c6f68952fbf9c4044bb49334d7"},{"path":"manifests/a/ABB/e-Design/1.17.0.0004/ABB.e-Design.yaml","sha256":"b452fceb1caa3e099cd473caf2255dab4277719625ae99b1e5c3d835d56f88c7"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"1.17.0.0004"}